        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, also in February 2024, we entered into several license and development agreements with third-party vendors (the “Vendor Agreements”), pursuant to which these vendors agreed to supply us a license to use certain intellectual property that will enable us to develop and deliver 5G products under the Alpha Agreements.",
        "start_character": 45549,
        "end_character": 45877
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Highly differentiated & innovative modem architecture: Unlike traditional DSP-based modem solutions, we employ a scalable modular modem design based on optimized data-flow dedicated hardware engines, which provides scalable products with optimized cost structure without the de-featuring approach that other competitors usually take.",
        "start_character": 26074,
        "end_character": 26407
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In February 2024, we entered into a Foundry Product Development Agreement and related agreement (the “Alpha Agreements”) with Alpha Holdings Co., Ltd.",
        "start_character": 44688,
        "end_character": 44838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the JDA, we are required to perform certain services to achieve specified development milestones, and the Operator is required to pay a one-time payment to us upon achievement of each milestone.",
        "start_character": 17775,
        "end_character": 17975
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct reviews for all products from the early stages of development to determine whether they qualify as strategic items under the U.S.",
        "start_character": 31587,
        "end_character": 31727
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have continuously focused on wireless communication product development since our establishment, and believe our core technologies and compatibility testing capabilities acquired during the development and sale of our competitive wireless communication chipsets are unique and not easily duplicated by new entrants in the market.",
        "start_character": 14814,
        "end_character": 15146
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed and commercialized a portfolio of 4G semiconductor solutions to address a variety of applications and market segments from high performance 4.75G (CAT12) solution to low power, low performance 4G IoT (CAT-M1/NB1).",
        "start_character": 27501,
        "end_character": 27732
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed and commercialized chipsets for various product categories corresponding to 4G, 4.5G and 4.75G including LTE-based IoT chipsets.",
        "start_character": 16958,
        "end_character": 17104
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to offer three different 5G chipset solutions, taking into account various market demands for performance, functionality, and price ranges, similar to our existing 4G LTE products.",
        "start_character": 19465,
        "end_character": 19653
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we differentiate ourselves from the dominant chipset provider in the market by providing customized solutions tailored to the specific needs of wireless carriers.",
        "start_character": 19753,
        "end_character": 19929
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As disclosed previously, we entered into a research and development agreement (the “Samsung Agreement”) with Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd (“Samsung”) in July 2020, pursuant to which Samsung agreed to provide us with certain development support, an intellectual property license, and mass production set up support to enable us to develop and produce 5G chipsets for our customers.",
        "start_character": 45878,
        "end_character": 46258
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-124183",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-124183-4739cce1c8b271ae",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-124183",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2019, we entered into a Joint Development Agreement (“JDA”) with the Operator for the design and development of 5G chipsets for FWA, mobile broadband and modules.",
